        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "急に話しかけてきたかと思えば、\r\n急に菓子を押しつけてきて……。",
            "enText": "I heard a student call out to me, and the \nminute I turned around, she shoved these \nchocolates in my hands…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -2988799492727388978,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "そのうえ、走って逃げるとは。",
            "enText": "Then she ran off. I didn't even \nhave time to think.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 7196449958047101660,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……しかし奴の走り、なかなかだったな。\nどこのクラスだ……？",
            "enText": "…Her form was pretty good though. \nWhat class is she in…?",
